<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>CV ATS Check</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #f6f8fa; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #1f2328; --muted: #59636e; --border: #d1d9e0;
    --fail: #cf222e; --fail-soft: #ffebe9; --accent: #0969da; --accent-text: #ffffff;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1117; --surface: #161b22; --text: #e6edf3; --muted: #9198a1; --border: #30363d;
      --fail: #da3633; --fail-soft: #2d1214; --accent: #2f81f7; --accent-text: #ffffff;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
         font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .lead { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .6rem;
          padding: 1.25rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .field { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .field:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  label { display: block; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 400; }
  p.hint { margin: .35rem 0 0; }
  input[type=file] { display: block; width: 100%; padding: .5rem; border: 1px dashed var(--border);
                     border-radius: .5rem; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: inherit; }
  input[type=file]::file-selector-button { min-height: 36px; margin-right: .75rem; padding: 0 .9rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .4rem; background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text); font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  textarea { display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 12rem; resize: vertical; padding: .65rem .75rem;
             border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .5rem; background: var(--bg);
             color: var(--text); font: inherit; }
  input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  button { min-height: 48px; padding: 0 1.75rem; border: 0; border-radius: .5rem;
           background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-text); font: inherit; font-weight: 700;
           cursor: pointer; }
  button:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }
  .error { background: var(--fail-soft); border-left: 5px solid var(--fail); border-radius: .4rem;
           padding: .75rem 1rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  ul.checks { margin: .25rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); }
  ul.checks li { margin: .2rem 0; }
  .privacy { margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  @media (max-width: 30rem) { button { width: 100%; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>CV ATS Check</h1>
<p class="lead">Check a CV against a job ad with explainable, local heuristics.</p>
{% if error %}<div class="error" role="alert">{{ error }}</div>{% endif %}
<form class="card" method="post" action="/check" enctype="multipart/form-data">
  <div class="field">
    <label for="cv">CV file <span class="hint">(.pdf or .docx, max 10 MB)</span></label>
    <input type="file" id="cv" name="cv" accept=".pdf,.docx" required>
  </div>

  <div class="field">
    <label for="job_text">Job ad <span class="hint">(optional; enables keyword and requirement checks)</span></label>
    <textarea id="job_text" name="job_text" aria-describedby="job-hint" placeholder="Paste the job ad text here">{{ job_text }}</textarea>
    <p class="hint" id="job-hint">Paste the whole ad, including headings such as “Requirements” and “Nice to have”.
    They let the tool weight must-have terms higher than nice-to-haves.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="field">
    <label for="job_file">…or upload the job ad as a text file</label>
    <input type="file" id="job_file" name="job_file" accept=".txt,.md,text/plain">
  </div>

  <button type="submit">Check CV</button>
</form>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="what-heading">
  <h2 id="what-heading">What is checked</h2>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>The CV alone: readable text, layout, contact details, section headings, dates, length and file hygiene.</li>
    <li>With a job ad: weighted keyword match (Swedish and English), repeated keywords, and the ad's requirements for experience, languages, work mode and location.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<p class="privacy">{{ privacy_note }} The file is read from a temporary folder and deleted when the report is made.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
